{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226600","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:6:1222660001:0":{"text":"꼼짝 마라!","source_cn":"束手就擒吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74424E20E8ED206A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222660002:1":{"text":"누구시죠?","source_cn":"谁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15954C1D987EA405","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222660003:1":{"text":"그건 저희가 묻고 싶은 말이에요!","source_cn":"我们才想问你呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F68105A0126637B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222660004:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222660005:1":{"text":"말하지 않겠다는 건가? 내가 누군지 알고 있을 텐데?","source_cn":"不说吗？你应该知道我是谁，瞒着我，可能不会有什么好下场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E3D15B3296C672D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222660006:0":{"text":"...전 나리안이라는 수리공이에요. 어선의 돛을 보수하곤 하죠.","source_cn":"……我叫纳莉安，是个修理工，经常帮渔船修补船帆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C9A836FD353D89B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222660007:0":{"text":"그렇다면 나리안 양, 당신은 수리공인데 어째서 금지령을 어기려던 거죠?","source_cn":"那么，纳莉安小姐，你是个本分的工人，为什么要违背禁令呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x365ACAEF978DE019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222660008:0":{"text":"전... 궁지에 몰려서 어쩔 수가 없었어요. 남동생이 큰 병에 걸렸는데 마지막으로 저를 만나고 싶다고 편지를 보내왔거든요.","source_cn":"我……我走投无路了。我收到弟弟的信，他说自己得了重病，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37D096F34390C145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222660009:0":{"text":"하지만 블러디 로즈가 봉쇄령을 내려 배가 출항하지 못하게 하는 바람에 급해서 어쩔 수 없이...","source_cn":"但是血薇帮下了封锁令，不许船只出港，我没有办法，又很着急……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D06123612755A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222660010:0":{"text":"그렇군요. 남동생과 아주 각별한가 봐요? 배 한 척과 선원을 고용하는 비용이 어마어마한데...","source_cn":"这样啊，纳莉安小姐和弟弟的感情一定很深，毕竟一整艘船和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DEC5DB14B73C2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222660011:0":{"text":"흥, 그 도박꾼... 아니, 그러니까... 저희는 사이가 워낙 각별해서 아무리 많은 돈을 써도 괜찮아요.","source_cn":"哼，那个赌鬼……不，我是说，我们感情确实很好，所以花再...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5EF3E555DFEA5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222660012:1":{"text":"선박의 출입을 통제했지만, 타당한 이유가 있을 경우에는 신청만 하면 특별 허가를 받고 출항할 수 있어.","source_cn":"虽然封锁了船只进出，但只要有正当理由，提出申请后，就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F30601724E06570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222660013:1":{"text":"게다가 심사 효율도 높아서 하루를 넘기지 않고 있지.","source_cn":"审核的批复效率很高，最多不超过一天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF09D41CDD3F84EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222660014:1":{"text":"이렇게 하지. 내가 급행 증명서를 발급해 줄 테니, 지금 바로 가서 신청하면 오늘 중으로 허가를 받을 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"这样吧，我给你开个加急证明，你现在去提交申请，今天之内...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FAE7F030C4C7104","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222660015:1":{"text":"네? 지금 절... 보내주시겠다는 건가요?","source_cn":"哎？你们这是要……要放我走？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCDA5367D477B7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222660016:1":{"text":"물론이지. 네가 규정을 어긴 건 사정이 있으니까. 블러디 로즈는 선량한 마을 주민을 난처하게 만들지 않아.","source_cn":"当然，你的违规情有可原。血薇帮不会为难善良的居民。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF0CE2A783BA22CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222660017:0":{"text":"힘들게 일해 번 돈을 불법 거래에 쓰지 말고 정식으로 출항 허가를 받도록 해.","source_cn":"你也不容易，没必要把血汗钱浪费在违法交易，去拿正规的离...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9051FAECCF9C5FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222660018:1":{"text":"그게... 아...","source_cn":"这……啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x144EB0AF31066A74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222660019:0":{"text":"왜 그러세요? 돈도 아끼고 남동생도 만날 수 있게 되었는데 기쁘지 않으세요?","source_cn":"怎么了？又能省下钱，又能见到弟弟，你不开心吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8074E4EE9DF1A19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222660020:0":{"text":"잘하면 내일 바로 출항할 수도 있겠는 걸요?","source_cn":"顺利的话，明天说不定就能离港出去了哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x266B82D383C4D46D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222660021:0":{"text":"...감동 받아서요. 고맙습니다. 지금 바로 가서 신청할게요.","source_cn":"……我只是太感动了。谢谢你们，我马上去写申请。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C13C5EECAA0A0C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:32:1222660022:0":{"text":"나리안은 고개 숙여 감사 인사를 전한 후, 어딘가 미심쩍은 표정으로 자리를 떴다","source_cn":"纳莉安深深地鞠躬道谢，面带疑惑地走远了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7B9DE7A2371DE74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222660023:0":{"text":"대체 뭐 하는 거야... 아니, 이렇게 그냥 놓아준다고? 완전 의심스럽잖아!","source_cn":"到底在搞什么……不是，你们这就放她走了？她很可疑啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B0212D8261311D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:34:1222660023":{"text":"대체 뭐 하는 거야... 아니, 이렇게 그냥 놓아준다고? 완전 의심스럽잖아!","source_cn":"到底在搞什么……不是，你们这就放她走了？她很可疑啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B0212D8261311D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1222660024:0":{"text":"붉은 닻, 우린 그렇게 멍청하지 않아. 베인! 이쪽으로.","source_cn":"红锚，我们没你想得那么蠢。瓦因！过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x195E91BA834B3361","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1222660025:0":{"text":"루카 님, 분부하십시오.","source_cn":"卢卡老大，您吩咐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7620799E9CDE3FD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1222660026:0":{"text":"멀찌감치 떨어져서 저 여인을 따라가도록 해. 알아채지 못하게 하고 그녀의 행동을 전부 다 내게 보고하도록.","source_cn":"你远远地跟上那个女人，不要打草惊蛇，把她之后的行动都汇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC30AC1465478E094","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1222660027:0":{"text":"네! ","source_cn":"是！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD57FE676D9F022B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1222660028:0":{"text":"그리고 붉은 닻 너는 지금 바로 그레이 텅을 찾아가도록 해. 너희들이 서로 잘 아는 사이라는 거 알아.","source_cn":"至于你，红锚，你现在去找灰舌，我知道你们很熟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60B10D7BD49BD09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1222660029:0":{"text":"만약 저 여인이 그레이 텅에게 가서 배를 사겠다고 한다면 배를 팔라고 전해.","source_cn":"你给灰舌带个话，如果那女人找灰舌买船，记住，卖给她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24ED19EA735A57F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1222660030:0":{"text":"정말 성가시구만... 돈 벌기가 하늘의 별 따기네.","source_cn":"真麻烦……想从你们手上挣点钱也太不容易了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0721093748F4465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1222660031:0":{"text":"지금 그만둬도 상관없지만 그렇게 되면 현상금이 언제 네 손에 쥐어질지는 장담할 수 없어.","source_cn":"你现在退出也可以，但我不保证赏金什么时候才能到你手中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F2A526F660CF042","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1222660032:0":{"text":"알겠다고! 네 말대로 하면 되잖아?","source_cn":"知道了！我照做还不行吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66CBE273892368A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1222660033:1":{"text":"어서 가봐.","source_cn":"快去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F3E7E18C8BE559C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1222660034:0":{"text":"나리안 양이... 나쁜 사람인가요?","source_cn":"纳莉安小姐……是坏人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EE726AE037FFCC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1222660035:0":{"text":"우리가 그녀에게 방법을 제시했으니 우리에게 거짓말을 한 게 아니라면 이제 어떻게 해야 할지 알겠지.","source_cn":"我们已经为她指明了道路，要是她没骗我们，现在也知道该怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC479822B1844892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1222660036:0":{"text":"만약 그래도 몰래 배를 사고 심지어 다른 수상쩍은 사람과 접촉한다면...","source_cn":"如果她还是选择私自买船，甚至和其他可疑的人接触……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCECC6F636770DC82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1222660037:0":{"text":"그렇다면 그 그레이브본 킬러의 꼬리를 잡을 수 있겠지!","source_cn":"那我们就抓到亡灵杀手的尾巴了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45F70E4F2E0F8913","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:34:0:1":{"text":"겉모습만 봐서는 안 돼","source_cn":"不能只看表面","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF36BFEFACEA676A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"겉모습만 봐서는 안 돼","female":"겉모습만 봐서는 안 돼","variant_male_record_index":"67484","variant_female_record_index":"67485","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:34:1:2":{"text":"멀리 내다봐야 큰일을 이룰 수 있는 법","source_cn":"放长线，钓大鱼","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA65CB9F9BBE2F38C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀리 내다봐야 큰일을 이룰 수 있는 법","female":"멀리 내다봐야 큰일을 이룰 수 있는 법","variant_male_record_index":"67486","variant_female_record_index":"67487","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:56:12602512:0":{"text":"선원 “붉은 닻”이 신비로운 구매자와 접선하는 틈을 타 우리는 루카와 함께 재빨리 그들을 에워쌌다.","source_cn":"趁着水手“红锚”和神秘买家接头，你们和卢卡迅速上前围住他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22401872066AC7E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_titl